cff-version: 1.2.0
title: odezoo
message: >-
  If you use odezoo, please cite it as below, and cite the paper of each model you use: odezoo
  info ID and each model's page give it.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Henrik
    family-names: Finsberg
    email: henriknf@simula.no
    affiliation: Simula Research Laboratory
abstract: >-
  A curated registry of ODE models, mostly cell models, stored as CellML or gotranx .ode, with a
  Python package and command line that search it and fetch each model's file exactly as it was
  recorded, verified by its sha256.
repository-code: https://github.com/ComputationalPhysiology/odezoo
url: https://computationalphysiology.github.io/odezoo
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
keywords:
  - ODE models
  - cell models
  - CellML
  - gotranx
